{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not turn MDC snapshot failure into terminal workflow failure.** A runtime or linkage failure from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` is passed through `finishInvocation`, returning durable `FAILED` before input processing or user code. A logging-binding fault can therefore permanently terminate user work. Treat MDC capture as optional or propagate an invocation-level infrastructure failure so Lambda retries, while leaving lifecycle hooks unstarted.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77KBbS","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":256,"observation_digest":"54dfe5da96eba9f5f72ef98e9b3d284692f6b7ea6c5ce35b32a0971bd93a8956","observation_id":"aro_v1_ktp6lwuw5ou7l5zo7ghjwpjii2","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:29:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nkiq5tjniw4p27rjtuhhmygruq","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"4f421deeed701315e1534fe2cc14ab78cd8eb482","reviewer":"codex","start_line":256,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_d5o54mrf54dszqvahv2so2qkug","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:29:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
